# Production Environment Setup

## Required for Role Management

# Download your service account key from Firebase Console:
# https://console.firebase.google.com/project/dgno-675a8/settings/serviceaccounts/adminsdk
# Save as 'service-account-key.json' in project root (this file is in .gitignore)
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./service-account-key.json

# Your Firebase project ID
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=dgno-675a8

# Stripe keys (set these after getting them from Stripe dashboard)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# Frontend environment (copy to app/.env.production)
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=dgno-675a8